#. どう？　模様替えしたの！
#. 新鮮じゃない？　ワクワクじゃない？
msgctxt "0001 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"What do you think? I redecorated! Isn't it so fresh?\n"
"Isn't it so EXCITING!?"
msgstr ""

#. どうもこうもあるか…いいから早く始めろ。
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Don't waste our time with stupid questions. Let's get\n"
"this over with."
msgstr ""

#. いいねぇ～、やる気だねぇ～！
#. 嫌いじゃないよ、そういうの。
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Good, good, you're rip-raring to go! Gotta say, I\n"
"don't hate it! Not at all!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、始めるからさ！
msgctxt "0004 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Okay then, let's get this show on the road!"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラは、
#. 自分の名前が書かれた席に着いてくださーい！
msgctxt "0005 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Everyone, please find your assigned seats!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こうして、再び幕は開く…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And so, the curtain opened once again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>命がけの裁判…命がけの騙し合い…命がけの裏切り…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A deadly judgment... A deadly deception... A deadly\n"
"betrayal...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>命がけの謎解き…命がけの言い訳…命がけの信頼…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A deadly riddle, a deadly defense, a deadly faith...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>命がけの……学級裁判…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A deadly...class trial...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
